  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n(173, 246)\n\n__173 × 2__ - 100 = 246 \n\n__**346 **____**- 100**__ = 246 \n\n246 = 246 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(148, 196)\n\n__148 × 2__ - 100 = 196 \n\n__296 ____- 100__ = 196\n\n196 = 196 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (142, 176)\n\n__142 × 2__ - 100 = 176 \n\n__284 ____- 100__ = 176\n\n184 ≠ 176 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) (169, 247)\n\n__169 × 2__ - 100 = 247 \n\n__338 ____- 100__ = 247\n\n238 ≠ 247 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) (127, 194)\n\n__127 × 2__ - 100 = 194 \n\n__254 ____- 100__ = 194\n\n154 ≠ 194 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) (154, 208)\n\n__154 × 2__ - 100 = 208 \n\n__308 ____- 100__ = 208\n\n208 = 208 (LHS = RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options, '(154, 208)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
